            "be1326677877_html": "Each bowl undergoes meticulous testing at every stage of its journey, ensuring that its purity mirrors its resonant quality. Every evaluation is a promise to protect your space and deliver a nurturing experience for both mind and body.\r",
            "be1472487617_html": "Sculptural piece designed for elevated sophistication.\r",
